<p>Conjures up mana into a powerful beam of lightning, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">72, 97, 117, 133, 147</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">216, 291, 350, 399, 442</acronym> damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">144, 194, 233, 266, 295</acronym> average)</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>